% expect-output: true
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: false
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: a resident face has the Type 1 dictionary's required
% entries. CharStrings holds every glyph the face has, .notdef included,
% and Private exists; a glyph the face lacks is absent, and neither
% dictionary can be changed.
% Expect: true, true, true, false, true.
/Times-Roman findfont /CharStrings get
dup /space known =
dup /.notdef known =
dup /eacute known =
dup /nosuchglyph known =
wcheck not /Times-Roman findfont /Private known and =
